---
import ContentLayout from "../layouts/ContentLayout.astro";
---

<ContentLayout
    title="About GSF"
    description="Learn about the Green Schools Foundation - a dedicated group of parents, alumni, educators, community leaders, and local business people committed to academic excellence."
    showBreadcrumbs={true}
    breadcrumbs={[
        { name: "About GSF", href: "/about-gsf" }
    ]}
>
    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>
            The Green Schools Foundation is a dedicated group of parents, devoted alumni, educators, community leaders, and local business people.
        </p>
        <p>
            The Foundation is dedicated to furthering academic excellence in the Green Schools by providing scholarships and academic classroom grants, which benefit our elementary, middle, and high school students. Become a board member by completing and submitting the <a href="/_files/ugd/GSF%20Trustee%20Application%202024.pdf" target="_blank">trustee application</a>.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="highlight-box mb-8">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Our Mission</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Engage with the community, schools, and families to provide resources that enrich the educational experience.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Our Vision</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Promote the pathway to excellence through educational grants, scholarships, and programs.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Programs We Sponsor</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Green Schools Foundation is the proud sponsor of the following programs. The proceeds from the Celebration of Education and contributions help to fund scholarships, classroom grants, and our other great programs.</p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Academy of Scholars</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">High school students are recognized for their academic excellence by achieving a GPA of 3.5 and higher. In the fall of 2024, 373 students qualified for the program.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Scholarships</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Scholarships are awarded to graduating seniors each year. In 2025, scholarships totaling $29,000 were awarded to 30 seniors.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Classroom Grants</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Academic classroom grants benefit students in all buildings. In the fall of 2024, $21,589.56 was awarded to grant recipients.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">School to Work Trades Scholarship</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Scholarships awarded to students pursuing careers in the skilled trades.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Laws of Life</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">A character essay contest where students are encouraged to write about their core values and ideals. Finalists are honored at a reception co-sponsored by GSF.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">PBIS</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Green Schools Foundation funds the district's PBIS (Positive Behavior Interventions and Support), a tiered system of support for all students. Green Local Schools has adopted: Be Safe, Be Kind, Be Responsible.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Book Club</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Helping to foster a love for reading, this program provides a high quality book to every student in Kindergarten through third grade, serving nearly 1,200 students.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Little Free Library</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Green Schools Foundation, Green Local Schools, the Green Branch Library, and the City of Green teamed up to make the "Little Free Library" available at Central Park.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Spotlight on Staff</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">Exceptional Green Schools staff are recognized at school board meetings and presented pawprint plaques.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Celebration of Education</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700">An annual event that showcases student achievements and talents through artwork, musical performances, and drama, while promoting local businesses and organizations. Family fun for all ages!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
